48 18.885-.393 40.07-13.013 55.535-6.083 7.536-18.219 3.48-18.613-6.204-.514-19.006-4.6-32.262-10.805-35.349-6.204 3.087-10.29 16.313-10.774 35.289-.212 9.624-12.499 13.861-18.643 6.265-16.948-20.701-14.315-47.213-12.953-55.535-6.961-6.295-14.194-17.765-11.863-37.346 2.633-29.72 27.601-33.563 54.234-21.306 25.059-11.41 49.12-9.503 53.75 17.675 3.722 21.637-3.874 34.137-11.32 40.976z\"\/><\/g><\/g><g id=\"pbmit-23\"\/><\/svg>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/div>\t\t<h2 class=\"pbmit-element-title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe take a number of additional safety precautions to protect our patients, including:\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/h2>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t<div class=\"pbmit-ihbox-contents\">\r\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pbmit-heading-desc\"><ul>\n<li>Providing lead jackets to protect patients from radiation during X-rays<\/li>\n<li>Avoiding the use of amalgam fillings, which contain mercury<\/li>\n<li>Avoiding the use of nickel in the metal framework of PFM crowns<\/li>\n<li>Avoiding the use of acid etchant in composite resin fillings<\/li>\n<li>Offering metal-free options like glass ceramic and zirconia ceramic in crown and bridge work<\/li>\n<li>Avoiding the use of silver cones in root canal fillings<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>We are committed to providing our patients with the highest level of safety and care. We believe that you should be able to feel confident that you are in good hands when you come to Dr. Dilip Dental Centre.<\/p><\/div>\t\t\t<\/div><!-- .pbmit-ihbox-contents -->\r\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/article><article class=\"pbmit-ele pbmit-ele-miconheading pbmit-miconheading-style-8 col-md-6   \">\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pbmit-ihbox pbmit-ihbox-style-8\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"pbmit-ihbox-headingicon\">\r\n\t<div class=\"pbmit-ihbox-wrap\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"pbmit-ihbox-icon\"><div class=\"pbmit-ihbox-icon-wrapper pbmit-icon-type-icon\">\t\t\t<svg id=\"glyph\" viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www